Comment: The CASTv2 sequence and the Default Media Receiver path follow what the public senders do, read in
 pychromecast (Apache-2.0, Home Assistant Libs) and GNOME Network Displays (GPL-3.0-or-later; read, never copied);
 the CastMessage field numbers are those of openscreen's cast_channel.proto (BSD-3-Clause, The Chromium Authors).
 tests/fake-cast-device.py grew from the cast study's receiver (row 81) and uses pychromecast's generated module at
 run time; the device setup endpoints it answers follow pychromecast 14.1.1 dial.py and rithvikvibhu's GHLocalApi.

